## Query and set resolution from the shell

```sh
# List connected outputs and available modes
xrandr

# Set the living-room TV output to 1080p for the Plex box
xrandr --output HDMI-1 --mode 1920x1080

# Current resolution only
xrandr | grep '\*'
```
